11275,"SANTANDER ALERTS SERVICE UPDATE
Valued Customer, Please note that starting from March 22, 2016, we will be introducing new online banking authentication procedures in order to protect the private information of all online banking users. You are required to confirm your online banking details with us as you will not be able to have access to your accounts until this has been done. As you're already registered for online banking all you need to do is to confirm your online banking details. Confirm your details Once you've completed this you'll be able to manage your money whenever you want, giving you more control of your finances. Regards Customer Service Santander Bank",d01,Banking and Financial Services,"GENERAL SETTINGS
