I NEED YOUR QUICK RESPONSE Calvary Greetings am a preacher with the Seed Harvest Ministry, and I would like to get advice from you. I believe the advice I need is secular to some extent, but do have the patience to understand my intention.  A few years ago I was in Baghdad, Iraq where I had established a little congregation where I preached regularly, but the war escalated and the church was converted to a hospital of sought. Before then, On one faithful day three American Soldiers came to me and left a trunk box of Money with me and swore to come back for it.  When the war in Iraq intensified I was escorted to My country Benin Republic West Africa, by the U.S. soldiers who felt the content of the trunk box was church documents and never cared to check the trunk box, when I was getting frustrated I returned to Iraq only to find out that two of the three Soldiers died in Battle while the last was declared MIA (Missing in Action).  Now I have the fund which belongs to the soldiers and which is Eight millions dollars ($8,000.000.00), but I have deposited it with a security company here in my country Benin Rep, and I was contacted in a letter dated 10th of May.2006 by the company asking me to indicate if I was in receipt of the letter as a sign that I am still living and still subscribed for their service.  I am interested in using a small fraction of this money, much less than ten percent for a reorganization of the work, but I do not need the rest and donor want to have any direct dealing with it, I need someone who will be able to use the fund better maybe for charity or something universally profitable, I have thought of doing it my self but, my ministry is the apocalypse and Believe and preach the soon coming which make me not indulgent in reliance on money or wealth in any form.  I also do not have the money that has accrued on the service and safe depositor the company that holds the trunk box, I will be glad if you have any interest in the direction of maybe managing or transmitting the fund as you prefer in your capacity like using it to help the motherless and people in the3rd world countries. Furthermore, I will like you to give me your phone number for easy and good communication.  Furthermore, I will be glad to get response from you through my direct email address pastor_jonesbell@mail.ru Regards. Pastor Jones Bell----------------------------------------------------------------------------ГЂГЄГ¶ГЁГї Г®ГІ ГЄГ®Г¬ГЇГ Г­ГЁГЁ ""ГЂГ¤Г Г¬Г Г­ГІ""! ГЏГ®Г¤ГЄГ«ГѕГ·ГҐГ­ГЁГҐ ГЇГ® ГўГ»Г¤ГҐГ«ГҐГ­Г­Г®Г© Г«ГЁГ­ГЁГЁ ГўГ¤ГўГ®ГҐ Г¤ГҐГёГҐГўГ«ГҐ!ГЃГҐГ±ГЇГ«Г ГІГ­Г»Г© Г¤Г®Г±ГІГіГЇ ГЄ ГіГЄГ°Г ГЁГ­Г±ГЄГЁГ¬ Г°ГҐГ±ГіГ°Г±Г Г¬ Г­Г Г¬Г ГЄГ±ГЁГ¬Г Г«ГјГ­Г®Г© Г±ГЄГ®Г°Г®Г±ГІГЁ!ГІГҐГ«. 563-0-563, 566-77-22http://www.adamant.ua/",d03,Logistics and Delivery,"GENERAL SETTINGS
